{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Painkiller is a reimagining of the classic franchise, featuring co-op play for up to three players and full offline support. Battle hordes of demons and titanic terrors across richly detailed gothic environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trapped in Purgatory, you are sentenced for your transgressions against Heaven. But the Voice of the Creator gives you a chance to redeem yourself. As one of the Champions, you are to stop the fallen angel Azazel who is about to unleash his demonic armies onto Earth. You will face hordes of enemies, demons with unique powers and three monstrous children of Azazel - the Nephilim.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you succeed in your mission and earn your salvation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Purgatory Is Your Playground - </strong>Jump, dash, and hook across vast biomes while fighting enemies with a host of new and classic Painkiller weapons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/1.gif?t=1750771492\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grotesque Terrors Await </strong>- Challenge a variety of enemies ranging from hordes of smaller demons to titanic terrors. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/2.gif?t=1750771492\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unleash The Pain</strong> - Utilize tarot cards to enhance your abilities and combine them with other players to obliterate your foes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/3.gif?t=1750771492\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose Your Character Wisely</strong> - Play as one of four distinctive characters - Ink, Void, Sol and Roch - and take advantage of their unique perks to boost your energy, health, power and damage.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/4.gif?t=1750771492\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2300120?t=1750771492","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2300120?t=1750771492","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/2d3fd1096153816c18349faff897271e93eb1840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750771492","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/2d3fd1096153816c18349faff897271e93eb1840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750771492","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Lots of fast-paced action, violence and gore."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Pre-Purchase Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/aa683be3e4a916b58244e863fcf9cc8d.avif?t=1750771492\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pre-order Now And Lock and Load With The Iron Crusade Skins Pack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 4 Medieval Skins For Each Character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 6 Unique Weapon Skins for the Stakegun, SMG, Shotgun, Rocket launcher, Handcanon and Electrodriver</p></p><br><h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/2d39b61aed23e2cb3b8362b9bb6dc2d0.avif?t=1750771492\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash Chaos with the Deluxe Edition: Raise hell in style with exclusive skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Painkiller Deluxe Edition Includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Base Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Season Pass: Weapon and Character Skins</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Painkiller is a reimagining of the classic franchise, featuring co-op play for up to three players and full offline support. Battle hordes of demons and titanic terrors across richly detailed gothic environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trapped in Purgatory, you are sentenced for your transgressions against Heaven. But the Voice of the Creator gives you a chance to redeem yourself. As one of the Champions, you are to stop the fallen angel Azazel who is about to unleash his demonic armies onto Earth. You will face hordes of enemies, demons with unique powers and three monstrous children of Azazel - the Nephilim.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you succeed in your mission and earn your salvation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Purgatory Is Your Playground - </strong>Jump, dash, and hook across vast biomes while fighting enemies with a host of new and classic Painkiller weapons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/1.gif?t=1750771492\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grotesque Terrors Await </strong>- Challenge a variety of enemies ranging from hordes of smaller demons to titanic terrors. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/2.gif?t=1750771492\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unleash The Pain</strong> - Utilize tarot cards to enhance your abilities and combine them with other players to obliterate your foes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/3.gif?t=1750771492\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose Your Character Wisely</strong> - Play as one of four distinctive characters - Ink, Void, Sol and Roch - and take advantage of their unique perks to boost your energy, health, power and damage.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/4.gif?t=1750771492\" /></div></p>","developers":["Anshar Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/fa89a77d18796ccbc571f178b67f348b671b529d/header.jpg?t=1750771492","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Painkiller \u00a9 2025 Anshar Studios S.A. Developed by Anshar Studios S.A. Published by Saber Interactive Inc. and 3D Realms Entertainment ApS. Painkiller\u2122 is a trademark of PLAION GMBH. Saber Interactive\u2122 and the Saber Interactive logo are trademarks of Saber Interactive Inc. 3D Realms\u2122 and the 3D Realms logo are trademarks of 3D Realms Entertainment ApS. Painkiller uses Unreal\u00ae Engine. Unreal\u00ae is a trademark or registered trademark of Epic Games, Inc. in the United States of America and elsewhere. Unreal\u00ae Engine, Copyright 1998 \u2013 2025, Epic Games, Inc. Powered by Wwise \u00a9 2006 \u2013 2025 Audiokinetic Inc. Uses Bink Video. Copyright (C) 1997-2025 by Epic Games Tools LLC. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"